== Usage ==
* Start the fight by '''pre-casting Shadow Refuge''' and '''knocking the enemy down''' with '''Signet of Judgment'''.
* Use '''Death's Charge''' to jump onto the knocked-down target and begin a chain of '''Iron Palm''' into '''Entangling Asp'''.
* Then use '''Stonesoul Strike''' and '''Signet of Toxic Shock'''.
* Spam '''Dancing Daggers''' for additional damage, or use it as a ranged alternative over '''Iron Palm''' if the target is out of melee range.
* You can effectively use both chains in any order, depending on your distance from the target.

== Counters ==

* Anti-Condition
* Long distance builds
* Knock down immunity
* Chain interruption (medium)